<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Miss Wheatley returns six weeks after starting as-needed budesonide-formoterol. With the milder weather and the changes in the kitchen she is much better: she uses one inhalation two or three times a week, mostly before walking out in the wind, and has not woken at night for a month. Her two-week peak flow diary shows a best of 400 L/min. She has been invited abroad to see her book through the press and expects to sail in about a month, a long crossing followed by a summer in England, and she wants a plan in case her chest is bad at sea. She is prone to seasickness on short boat trips. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Control</td><td>Asthma Control Test 21; reliever two or three times a week; no night waking for a month</td></tr><tr><td>Peak flow</td><td>Personal best 400 L/min</td></tr><tr><td>Upcoming</td><td>A long sea crossing in about a month and a summer abroad</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.18"/>
    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No night waking; slight wheeze in cold wind only</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hoarseness or thrush</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Nausea on short boat trips in the past</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Looking forward to the journey, with some worry about falling ill far from help</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

